config TOUCHSCREEN_FOCALTECH_0FLASH_MMI
	bool "FocalTech 0-flash touchscreen (ginna, SPI, dual-source w/ ChipOne)"
	depends on SPI_MASTER
	default n
	help
	  FocalTech FT8756-family touch controller found on some ginna
	  (Moto E 2020) panel variants (compatible = "focaltech,fts",
	  panel-supplier "hlt"), communicating over SPI. Ported from Motorola's
	  out-of-tree motorola-kernel-modules (android-10-release-qzk,
	  drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_0flash_mmi) since it was never
	  carried into the mainline kernel-msm/LineageOS tree (which only kept
	  the older I2C-only focaltech_touch/focaltech_mmi drivers).

	  Built for the FT8756/FT8006S_AA/FT8009 SPI protocol family
	  (focaltech_spi_v1_1_1.c) as the closest match for a 2020 budget
	  Motorola panel; the exact chip ID isn't independently confirmed.
